# Container-First Architecture Rules

## System Design
- Host: Minimal (drivers, Docker, GPU, network, PTP only)
- Containers: All robot code (ROS 2, Python, application logic)
- Storage: /data/{logs,config,models,sessions} with bind mounts

## No Bare-Metal Code
- ❌ NO ROS 2 on host
- ❌ NO Python packages on host (except Docker tools)
- ❌ NO ros2 launch commands on host
- ❌ NO systemd services for ROS nodes

## Container Management
- Use docker-compose.production.yml
- Helper: scripts/deployment/deploy_containers.sh
- Auto-start: isaac-containers.service (systemd)

## Documentation
- Single source: SETUP.md
- Architecture details: docs/setup/CONTAINER_FIRST_ARCHITECTURE.md
- No migration guides, no update guides, no verbose docs
